-- l4 batch over a rule GIVEN with a TYPICALLY default
-- (specs/todo/TYPICALLY-ONE-BEHAVIOUR-SPEC.md, W3).

@export Rule default
GIVEN `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
      `is adult` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`can contract` MEANS `is adult` AND `has capacity`

#EVAL `can contract` TRUE TRUE
